Q what is this life of man
A a road leading to the hereafter
road - flow stream riding visioning observing realizing wishing now after beginning
praise - raised humanity from their limited existence and knowledge to the realization of Truth
Q what is definition of man
Q what is relation of man to what
Q what is man 
A an atom 
A tree in life of knowledge & beauty


Q what is man's form
A free not binding him to any place or time
A covered him under the veil of protection of an eternal life
A a jewel
Q what makes it jewel
A his gazing with love compassion
Q what is knowledge
A drops of a jewel melted into water
Q what properties of man
A taught all there is to known in creation
A seeing feeling
A power over everything
A sovereign 
A wisest
A granted with mind
A hiding secrets names
Q where is the origin
A in his names hidden as the Gentle, and the Mighty One
man's secret vs God's secret
man's secret in God's secret
Q whom presented to whom
A man to creation
Q what is affect of man to creation
creation is infinite width & depth
Q what is man first sin
A pride against creation
Q what is it man's pride
A God's power manifested over him as wrath & fire
ocean of hope vs divine power & wrath

